Description: G1 Light Sync unofficial companion for Mitsuko Phantom G1
 Independent desktop controls for the Phantom G1, including USB HID control, built-in
 firmware effects, live PipeWire music reactive modes, screen sync, and paired phone control over Wi-Fi or USB, including iOS Bonjour discovery.
